  {
   "what": "art buttons (the whole console, shown on a tall narrow screen, 2026-10-17)",
   "source": "measured 2026-10-17 by colour masks on the site's own art (play/cores/gb/art.mjs BEZEL images), checked on 3-4x gridded crops: GameBoyConsole.png 496x843: d-pad cross 58..170 x 479..591, B cap centre (340.5,547.5) dia 54, A (415,513.5) dia 53, SELECT pill centre (186,647), START (263,646.5), slant -25deg (the float pad's measured slant); GameBoyColorConsole.png and the four colour shells (all 505x852, identical to 2 px): d-pad 66..176 x 475..585, B (333.5,543.5) dia 52, A (416,517) dia 52, SELECT (219.5,661) 37x12, START (287.5,661); GameBoyColorPokemonConsole.svg rendered at 722x1250: d-pad 70..234 x 743..911, B (484.5,849.5) dia 81, A (614.5,807) dia 82, SELECT (304,1036.5) 56x19, START (411,1037.5) 58x23. Hit areas are the printed button plus a thumb's margin (d-pad about 4 px a side, face buttons about 1.25x, pills about 1.2x long and 1.4x to 2x thick). Used only while the whole console is shown (setArtView); the cropped band keeps the float pad",
   "licence": "site-owned measurement of the site's own artwork"
  },
